d, 26 Aug 2026 11:55:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ai-giant-anthropic-in-talks-to-lease-massive-bastrop-county-data-center-sources-said</guid></item><item><title>SpaceX 计划通过收购 444 英亩的土地在布朗斯维尔港口附近进行扩张</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/spacex-plans-expansion-near-brownsville-port-through-444-acre-acquisition</link><description>德克萨斯州哈林根（ &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/spacex-plans-expansion-near-brownsville-port-through-444-acre-acquisition.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 11:40:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/spacex-plans-expansion-near-brownsville-port-through-444-acre-acquisition</guid></item><item><title>AI 安全指数 9 级实验室没有一个得分高于 C+</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ai-safety-index-grades-9-labsnot-one-scored-above-a-c</link><description>分数本身并不是这个人工智能安全指数中最尖锐的部分。评审员指出，得分最高的四个实验室 Anthropic、OpenAI、Google DeepMind 和 Meta 都已经削弱或悄悄放弃了之前的公开承诺，即如果他们的系统接近规定的风险阈值，就会暂停开发，专家组将这种转变描述为移动球门柱。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ai-safety-index-grades-9-labsnot-one-scored-above-a-c.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 11:25:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ai-safety-index-grades-9-labsnot-one-scored-above-a-c</guid></item><item><title>JWST 发现了一颗比恒星亮 1000 亿倍的奇异“黑洞星”</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/jwst-spots-a-bizarre-black-hole-star-100-billion-times-brighter-than-a-star</link><description>天文学家可能发现了一个全新的宇宙物体：一颗巨大的“黑洞星”，它可以解释充满早期宇宙的神秘红点。麻省理工学院和其他机构的天文学家发现了一个异常亮红色的物体，其历史可以追溯到早期宇宙。乍一看，它就像一颗巨大的恒星，其尺寸与我们的太阳系相当。然而，它的能量输出却是非凡的。该物体产生的能量大约是任何已知恒星物理产生的能量的 1000 亿倍，使其能量更接近黑洞的水平。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/jwst-spots-a-bizarre-black-hole-star-100-billion-times-brighter-than-a-star.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 11:10:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/jwst-spots-a-bizarre-black-hole-star-100-billion-times-brighter-than-a-star</guid></item><item><title>人工智能代理难以进行原创科学研究</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ai-agents-struggle-to-perform-original-scientific-research</link><description>关于人工智能未来的众多预测之一是，模型有一天将能够自行进行科学研究，而将人类排除在外。他们已经可以编写代码、运行实验和搜索科学文献，但进行开放式研究需要能力的重大飞跃。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ai-agents-struggle-to-perform-original-scientific-research2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 10:55:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ai-agents-struggle-to-perform-original-scientific-research</guid></item><item><title>独家报道：人工智能创始人放弃贝索斯支持的普罗米修斯，转而为宇宙建模</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/exclusive-the-ai-founders-who-walked-away-from-bezosbacked-prometheus-to-model-the-universe</link><description>曾经被提名领导杰夫·贝索斯支持的普罗米修斯计划的研究二人组，公布了他们自己构建的东西：一个人工智能模型，可以吸收和产生海量的信息，以至于一台单独的计算机可能无法处理它。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/exclusive-the-ai-founders-who-walked-away-from-bezosbacked-prometheus-to-model-the-universe.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 10:40:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/exclusive-the-ai-founders-who-walked-away-from-bezosbacked-prometheus-to-model-the-universe</guid></item><item><title>时空可能只是宇宙的一层，嵌入我们不理解的更深层次的现实中</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/spacetime-may-be-just-one-layer-of-the-universeembedded-in-a-deeper-reality-we-dont-understand</link><description>这意味着宇宙可能比我们想象的要多得多。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/spacetime-may-be-just-one-layer-of-the-universeembedded-in-a-deeper-reality-we-dont-understand.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 10:25:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/spacetime-may-be-just-one-layer-of-the-universeembedded-in-a-deeper-reality-we-dont-understand</guid></item><item><title>设计忠诚度：人工智能代理和利益冲突</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/designing-loyalty-ai-agents-and-conflicts-of-interest</link><description>本简报探讨了人工智能代理带来的利益冲突风险，并呼吁对开发人员和部署人员施加忠诚义务。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/designing-loyalty-ai-agents-and-conflicts-of-interest2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 10:10:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/designing-loyalty-ai-agents-and-conflicts-of-interest</guid></item></channel></rss>